message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "disslucc: Land Use and Cover Change Modeling on top of DisSModel"
abstract: >-
  Land use and land cover change (LUCC) modeling, raster-only,
  script-first, on top of dissmodel. LuccME's components
  (demand, potential, allocation) in Python; agreement with
  TerraME/LuccME is checked in LambdaGeo/disslucc-benchmark.
